#
# Key layout of "Kernarium Keyboard" (1af4:0002), the virtio-input device that
# carries the side keys of the host application: Power, Volume Up and Down,
# Back and Home. Android would otherwise give it Generic.kl, which maps every
# key of a full keyboard, and then counts it as a hardware keyboard that is
# always attached (Configuration.keyboard, the on-screen keyboard rules). The
# host's keyboard is its own device (1af4:0003), present only while a keyboard
# is.

key 116   POWER
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 158   BACK
key 172   HOME
